### 注册用户
POST http://localhost:8080/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "lisi",
  "password": "123456",
  "email": "lisi@example.com"
}
### 登录用户
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "lisi",
  "password": "123456"
}
### 登录用户（错误密码）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "lisi",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}
### 获取用户信息（用新 Token）
GET http://localhost:8080/auth/info
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJsaXNpIiwiaWF0IjoxNzc5MDcxMzA1LCJleHAiOjE3Nzk2NzYxMDV9.tjCrDn9wh9MBfWoZI6JvpHOWhnDrUD9vNSTJicL8Pr4

